@kerneldreams/tools — OpenClaw, pi-mono
================================================================================


This package includes code adapted from the following MIT-licensed projects:

- OpenClaw (src/agents)
  Copyright (c) OpenClaw Foundation
  https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw — MIT License

  - src/fs/edit-diff.ts, edit-replacements.ts, file-diff.ts — vendored
    from src/agents/sessions/tools/ (commit 071246fb, 2026-10-02): fuzzy edit
    matching with replacement on original offsets, line-ending preservation,
    diff receipts. Small helpers (line endings, levenshtein, utf16 slice) in
    src/fs/edit-support.ts.
  - src/fs/apply-patch.ts — hunk location tiers after
    src/agents/apply-patch-update.ts (unified diff instead of the Codex format).
  - src/exec/, src/node/processes.ts — exec/process shape (yieldMs → background
    → poll/kill) after src/agents/bash-tools*.ts and bash-process-registry.ts.

- pi-mono (packages/coding-agent), Copyright (c) Mario Zechner
  https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono — MIT License
  Ported from pi coding-agent (packages/coding-agent/src/core/tools/, via the
  pi-nrchat fork): read, ls, find, grep tools (schemas, limits, output format),
  truncate.ts and path-utils.ts (src/fs/read.ts, search.ts, truncate.ts,
  paths.ts).

